# CR 613.8a, a reviewer's probe: Ygra enters, then Puppet Crafting enchants Mox Jet ("Enchanted permanent is a Construct
# creature with base power and toughness 5/5 in addition to its other types"), a static ability with the later timestamp.
# Applying it changes what Ygra's "Other creatures are Food artifacts" applies to, so Ygra's effect waits for it: the Jet is
# an artifact creature, a Construct and a Food. It has Ygra's "{2}, {T}, Sacrifice this permanent: You gain 3 life" too, and
# Bot1 activates it: 3 life, and the Jet goes to the graveyard as a Food, so Ygra gets two +1/+1 counters; Puppet Crafting,
# attached to nothing, follows it (CR 704.5m).

